32. Find Product Generating Maximum Revenue

PySpark:

from pyspark.sql.functions import sum

df.groupBy("product_id") \
  .agg(sum("amount").alias("revenue")) \
  .orderBy("revenue",
           ascending=False) \
  .limit(1)

SQL:

SELECT product_id,
SUM(amount) revenue
FROM sales
GROUP BY product_id
ORDER BY revenue DESC
LIMIT 1;
